### Actualizar empresa (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/empresas/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nit": "900123456-1",
  "razon_social": "TransMovil Actualizada S.A.S",
  "contacto_principal": "Maria Lopez",
  "status": "active"
}

###

### Actualizar empresa parcial (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/empresas/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contacto_principal": "Carlos Gomez"
}
